# T1. The demo path, SIMULATED: teach a pick-and-hold-out on the left arm, replay it, and "Let go?".
# Recording is teleop (prepared at the terminal, Confirmed at the walker) at 60°/s; it samples the follower's own
# readings while the person moves the teaching arm. The terminal marks a grasp just before the gripper closes on the
# object; the recording ends with a stop and is saved, and as it ends holding, the Pi asks "Let go?" itself.
# Then the arm goes back to where the skill starts, the object goes back, and the skill replays from its own file
# title, ends HOLDING, and the Pi asks "Let go?" again. Every motion needs its own Confirm press.
# SIMULATED arms. Run: node dist/walker.mjs simulate --arms --script test/sim/skills/01-record-replay-let-go.walk
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key pose-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 5000 motion command arm.go_to_pose completed operator_cli
# Teach.
key leader-match-left
wait 100
key object-left
expect sim left gripper holds an object at 12°
key record-left
expect motion target teleop.start operator_cli: Record a movement: the left arm copies its teaching arm
expect spoke Record a movement: the left arm copies its teaching arm. Park the walker and lock the brakes, then press Confirm.
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command teleop.start started operator_cli
expect motion recording started sim_taught
key leader-teach-left
wait 1100
key grasp-left
expect motion recording grasp left
expect motion grasp left active
expect 5000 sim leader teaching done
absent 300 motion fault
key operator-stop
expect motion command teleop.start stopped operator_cli
expect motion recording ended sim_taught
# Letting go is always possible: the stop lets off the squeeze (goal = where it is) and "Let go?" is offered at once,
# to where the gripper was when the grasp was marked.
expect motion target gripper.release walker_local: Let go?
expect spoke Let go? Park the walker and lock the brakes, then press Confirm.
wait 200
key inspect-grip-left
expect sim left gripper goal-present=0 limit=300
key record-finish
expect motion skill-saved sim_taught
key inspect-left
expect sim limit=600,600,600,600,600,300
# The person takes the object, then presses Confirm: only the gripper opens.
key object-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command gripper.release started walker_local
expect 3000 motion command gripper.release completed walker_local
expect motion grasp left ended
# Replay: back to where it starts, the object back on the tray, then the skill from its own title.
key pose-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 5000 motion command arm.go_to_pose completed operator_cli
key object-left
key skill-run-taught
expect motion target skill.run operator_cli: Hand it over (SIMULATED teaching)
expect spoke Hand it over (SIMULATED teaching). Park the walker and lock the brakes, then press Confirm.
wait 2100
key c
expect motion command skill.run started operator_cli
expect 3000 motion skill grasp left
expect 10000 motion command skill.run completed operator_cli
expect motion target gripper.release walker_local: Let go?
key inspect-left
expect sim limit=600,600,600,600,600,300
key object-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 3000 motion command gripper.release completed walker_local
absent 1000 motion fault
key q
